{"availability":"available","full":"y0sif/whisrs","name":"whisrs","description":"Voice for the Linux desktop: dictation, read-aloud, and voice-driven LLM commands. Wayland & X11: Hyprland, Sway, Niri, GNOME, KDE. Cloud or fully offline. Written in Rust.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Rust","stars":139,"forks":39,"created":"2026-03-15T00:30:29Z","updated":"2026-10-18T15:33:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://y0sif.github.io/whisrs/","topics":["dictation","hyprland","linux","llm","rust","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","text-to-speech","transcription","voice-to-text","wayland","whisper"],"demo":"https://y0sif.github.io/whisrs/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.869Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.869Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.869Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.689Z","stars":129,"forks":38},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:20.929Z","stars":130,"forks":38},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:27:16.343Z","stars":133,"forks":39},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:29:20.093Z","stars":138,"forks":39},{"at":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.869Z","stars":139,"forks":39}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Voice for the Linux desktop, written in Rust: dictation, read-aloud, and voice-driven LLM commands.","Speech-to-text for Wayland, X11, Hyprland, Sway, Niri, GNOME, and KDE. Press a hotkey, speak, and your words appear at the cursor, in any app, any window manager, any desktop environment. Select text and whisrs reads it aloud (text-to-speech via Groq, OpenAI, Deepgram, or a local sidecar). Or say what you want and an LLM writes it at your cursor. Supports cloud transcription (Groq, Deepgram, OpenAI) and fully offline local transcription via whisper.cpp. Fast, private, open source.","Dictation tools like Wispr Flow and Superwhisper are not available on Linux. whisrs fills that gap natively: a single Rust daemon with layout-aware keyboard injection (AltGr and dead keys included), per-compositor window tracking, and pluggable backends. What started as a dictation tool has grown into a voice layer for the whole desktop: speech in (dictation, voice commands), speech out (read any selection aloud), one hotkey each."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/y0sif/whisrs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"10eae296c3581335e3e8c69971822d8e34f8792fe7604c7ec2534d9636ecc9bb","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.856Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.971Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Voice for the Linux desktop, written in Rust: dictation, read-aloud, and voice-driven LLM commands.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/y0sif/whisrs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"After install, run whisrs setup to configure your backend, API keys, permissions, and keybindings.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/y0sif/whisrs/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"10eae296c3581335e3e8c69971822d8e34f8792fe7604c7ec2534d9636ecc9bb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/y0sif/whisrs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.971Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-18T15:33:13Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/y0sif/whisrs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.972Z","hash":"10eae296c3581335e3e8c69971822d8e34f8792fe7604c7ec2534d9636ecc9bb","originalBytes":15326,"storedBytes":15326,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.869Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Streaming","Image, audio & video AI","Self-hosted apps"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://y0sif.github.io/whisrs/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T07:42:48.987Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-1